# Default Server URL on the login screen (fleet-dashboard/src/App.tsx,
# fleet-dashboard/src/views/Login.tsx). Not a secret — the same hostname is
# baked into every desktop installer and documented in server/DEPLOY.md — so
# it's checked in rather than set per-deploy-platform. Vite loads this file
# automatically for any production build (`vite build`), including Vercel's,
# with no dashboard configuration needed.
#
# The field stays editable in the UI; this only supplies the default.
VITE_FLEET_API=https://137-184-103-51.sslip.io
